# Unity-regenerated — never commit
**/Library/
**/Logs/
**/Temp/
**/obj/
**/Builds/
**/Build/
**/UserSettings/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/

# Generated by Unity on editor open
**/*.csproj
**/*.sln
**/*.unityproj
**/*.suo
**/*.tmp
**/*.user
**/*.userprefs
**/*.pidb
**/*.booproj
**/*.svd
**/*.pdb
**/*.opendb
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.ipa

# OS junk
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# 2026-05-19: un-ignore unity-mcp's Editor/Tools/Build/ source folder.
# The generic **/Build/ rule above was intended for Unity project build
# output, but the unity-mcp package happens to have a "Build" subdirectory
# of C# source. Without these negations BuildJob.cs etc never get committed.
!**/Packages/com.coplaydev.unity-mcp/Editor/Tools/Build/
!**/Packages/com.coplaydev.unity-mcp/Editor/Tools/Build/**
